member.summary:
Sections some connection wanted in the last projection but could not subscribe because the binding reader
did not answer (not resident / not ready) or a bound entity was not live. Residency decides loads from this;
Sections only waiting for frame room are not listed. Ascending key order.

Entity half of a Section partition record (ADR-119 决策 7): the block entities of one Section, each under its own
number, with the number watermark at capture. Entity rows share 's row encoding;
rows are in ascending counter order, so the same entities always encode to the same bytes.
